{"availability":"available","full":"0xEmmo/koko","name":"koko","description":"Kòkó: book independent photographers, barbers, braiders and makeup artists in Lagos. Installable React + TypeScript PWA with live availability, slot holds, deposits and a studio dashboard.","category":"Design","language":"TypeScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-10-11T16:00:39Z","updated":"2026-10-11T16:02:00Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://koko-omega-amber.vercel.app","topics":["accessibility","booking-app","frontend","nigeria","playwright","portfolio-project","pwa","react","typescript","vite","vitest"],"demo":"https://koko-omega-amber.vercel.app/","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T19:50:51.523Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-11T19:50:51.523Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-11T19:50:51.523Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-11T19:50:51.523Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["React"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Book the hands behind the work. Kòkó is a booking web app for independent creatives in Lagos and Abuja: photographers, barbers, braiders and makeup artists who run their own diaries. Clients browse real portfolios, pick a time that is actually free, and secure it with a deposit. Creatives get a small studio dashboard for their week.","It is a front-end project: everything runs in the browser against a mock API that lives in this repo, so it can be cloned and run with no keys and no backend."],"features":["Discover creatives by craft, city, price and availability. Filters live in the URL, so a filtered list can be shared or bookmarked. On phones the extra filters move into a bottom sheet.","Book a slot in four steps: service, time, details, deposit. Availability comes from opening hours, service length, buffers between clients, lead time and the existing diary.","Your slot is held for 10 minutes while you fill in details, with a visible countdown. Another tab (or another person) can't take it in the meantime, and if a slot you were looking at gets booked elsewhere it disappears…","Pay a deposit by card or bank transfer. Cards are checked (Luhn, expiry, CVV, brand detection for Verve, Visa and Mastercard) and a pretend gateway can approve, decline or report insufficient funds, so the error paths…","Manage bookings: reschedule (up to twice) or cancel, with the policy applied: free cancellation inside the creative's notice window, deposit kept after it. Each booking keeps a history and can be added to a calendar as…"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/0xEmmo/koko/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"e06abd463fe2962921c6e2e837b88727a5393fff7dc4fdae6566847022ac93ee","extractedAt":"2026-10-11T19:50:51.637Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T19:50:51.637Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Book the hands behind the work. Kòkó is a booking web app for independent creatives in Lagos and Abuja: photographers, barbers, braiders and makeup artists who run their own diaries. Clients browse real portfolios, pick a time that is actually free, and secure it with a deposit. Creatives get a small studio dashboard for their week.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/0xEmmo/koko/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"e06abd463fe2962921c6e2e837b88727a5393fff7dc4fdae6566847022ac93ee","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/0xEmmo/koko/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-11T19:50:51.637Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-11T16:02:00Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/0xEmmo/koko/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-11T19:50:51.637Z","hash":"e06abd463fe2962921c6e2e837b88727a5393fff7dc4fdae6566847022ac93ee","originalBytes":7541,"storedBytes":7541,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["run","npm","creatives","photos","studio","time","each","tests","any","api","app","book","booking","build","creative","desktop","discover","first","lagos","lightbox","mock","network","real","see","service","slot","another","bookings","